# DeXCam Personal Android Application

This is an independent Android application for managing USB/UVC cameras in Samsung DeX environment.

## Structure
- app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
- app/src/main/java/ai/tigeriq/dexcam/
- app/src/main/res/
- app/build.gradle.kts
- settings.gradle.kts

## Permissions Required
- USB_HOST
- CAMERA
- ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION (for USB serial debugging)

## Features
- USB UVC device detection
- Camera preview with surface view
- DeX window management
- Auto-launch on Reverse Charge signal
- Safe recovery on USB/camera disconnect

